{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12106110","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12106110","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1210611001:1":{"text":"まぁ、あなたがヤマヨモギを採って来てくれたの？ありがとう！あとは自分でやるから大丈夫よ。","source_cn":"您采来的山蓬草？啊……谢谢您！我自己来就好！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x08D1076A51550A6C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"まぁ、あなたがヤマヨモギを採って来てくれたの？ありがとう！あとは自分でやるから大丈夫よ。","female":"まぁ、あなたがヤマヨモギを採って来てくれたの？ありがとう！あとは自分でやるから大丈夫よ。","variant_male_record_index":"130129","variant_female_record_index":"130130","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210611002:1":{"text":"あなたたちはシンドバッドのお友だち？本当にごめんなさいね、村がこんな状況で驚いたでしょう……","source_cn":"实在不好意思，你们是辛巴达的朋友吧？第一次来村里，就让...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BBF7F09DBB65D9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210611003:1":{"text":"大丈夫ですよ！これぐらいじゃロンロンたちは驚きません！","source_cn":"这不算什么啦！我们什么风浪都见过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0212365E6109B6AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210611004:1":{"text":"格好を見るに、島の住人ではないようね……？","source_cn":"看你们的穿着，不像是本地人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCACFE45FD66C816","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210611005:1":{"text":"もしかして、シンドバッドが砂浜で拾ったっていうカモ――あ、いえ、お友だち？","source_cn":"难道你们就是辛巴达在海滩上捡到的冤大头——呃——朋友？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF25A8171E453323","variant_